Error [E0212]: `xs` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `window` is still looking into it
  --> named_range_view_blocks_owner_resize_and_replacement.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     xs.push(4)
    |     ^^
 Why: `window` is a live read view into `xs[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `window` before changing `xs`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212

Error [E0224]: This call writes `xs`, but `xs` has no `&` mark
  --> named_range_view_blocks_owner_resize_and_replacement.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     xs.push(4)
    |     ^^
 Why: The method is declared with `&self`, so the call writes the named place it is called on; the mark sits on that place, the same way `edit(&buf)` and `consume(^text)` mark arguments
 Fix: Write `&xs`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0224
